Flock & Facility Log (18 November 2026)




Urgent Isolation Capacity Strain: An influx of extra birds requiring quarantine and isolation has severely strained current facility capacity, directly interfering with normal flock operations and spatial management.


Critical Supply Deficits: Immediate procurement is required for essential flock health and housing items—specifically praziquantel for parasite management and additional movable coops to securely handle the overflow of isolated birds.


Platform Accessibility Barriers: E-commerce attempts to source necessary veterinary and housing supplies on Shopee Thailand encountered persistent system failures, including broken search functionality rendering blank white screens and uncopyable Thai AI chat messages that blocked essential supplier communication.




